CWEs: CWE-759 (Use of a One-Way Hash without Salting) - Medium Confidence, CWE-326 (Inadequate Encryption Strength) - High Confidence, CWE-918 (Improperly Controlled Generation of Random Numbers) - Medium Confidence, CWE-764 (Insecure Password Storage/Comparison) - High Confidence

