- Implement robust error handling around LDAP operations to manage exceptions gracefully without exposing detailed errors.
- Ensure secure configuration of LDAP connections, especially in production environments, and avoid hardcoding sensitive data like server addresses.
- Filter out unnecessary details from the LDAP response before returning it to the client.

